{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource holding kube-state-metrics and optional ovnkube series",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Reference OVN-Kubernetes dashboard. Requires a `k8s_cluster_name` label on the queried series. Controller restarts and node-agent DaemonSet status use kube-state-metrics. NB\u2013SB e2e timestamps need ovnkube controller scrape.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Requirements and scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Scope\nReference dashboard for OVN-Kubernetes (`ovnkube-controller` / `ovnkube-node`) on one cluster. It is not deployed by nke-stack. Import this JSON and select a Prometheus datasource.\n\nNKE can use **calico** or **ovn-kubernetes** (`cluster.cniName`). All panels are empty when OVN-Kubernetes is not the CNI. Without an ovnkube controller metrics scrape, only the optional NB\u2013SB timestamp and build-info panels are empty; the kube-state-metrics panels can still render.\n\n### Required (kube-state-metrics only)\n- **ovnkube-controller restarts** \u2014 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{container=\"ovnkube-controller\"}`\n- **Node agent readiness / availability** \u2014 `kube_daemonset_*` for `ovnkube-node` in `ovn-kubernetes`\n\n### Optional (ovnkube controller metrics scrape)\n- **NB\u2013SB e2e timestamp difference** \u2014 `ovnkube_controller_nb_e2e_timestamp - ovnkube_controller_sb_e2e_timestamp`\n- Build info \u2014 `ovnkube_controller_build_info`\n\nCPU/memory panels that need **process-exporter** (`namedprocess_namegroup_*`, job `process-exporter`) are omitted. Resource and workqueue rows are omitted for the same reason: they need ovnkube controller/node metric endpoints that nke-stack does not scrape by default."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Ovnkube Controller",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ovnkube-controller restarts",
      "description": "Restart events in the last 5 minutes for container ovnkube-controller. Uses kube-state-metrics only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",container=\"ovnkube-controller\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "120s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "interval": "120s"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "NB\u2013SB e2e timestamp difference",
      "description": "ovnkube_controller_nb_e2e_timestamp minus ovnkube_controller_sb_e2e_timestamp. Empty when ovnkube controller metrics are not scraped.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "ovnkube_controller_nb_e2e_timestamp{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",instance=~\"$instance\"} - ovnkube_controller_sb_e2e_timestamp{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "nb-sb e2e timestamp diff on {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "120s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "interval": "120s"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Node agent readiness",
      "description": "Ready vs not-ready ovnkube-node DaemonSet pods (kube-state-metrics).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "kube_daemonset_status_number_ready{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}",
          "legendFormat": "READY",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "120s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "kube_daemonset_status_number_available{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"} + kube_daemonset_status_number_unavailable{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"} - kube_daemonset_status_number_ready{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}",
          "legendFormat": "NOT READY",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "120s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "interval": "120s"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Node agent availability",
      "description": "Available vs unavailable ovnkube-node DaemonSet pods (kube-state-metrics).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "kube_daemonset_status_number_available{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}",
          "legendFormat": "AVAILABLE",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "120s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "kube_daemonset_status_number_unavailable{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",daemonset=\"ovnkube-node\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}",
          "legendFormat": "UNAVAILABLE",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "120s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "interval": "120s"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Build info",
      "description": "ovnkube_controller_build_info. Empty when ovnkube controller metrics are not scraped.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "ovnkube_controller_build_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",namespace=\"ovn-kubernetes\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "branch",
                "revision",
                "version",
                "goversion"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "branch": "Branch",
              "goversion": "Go",
              "revision": "Revision",
              "version": "Version"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "nke",
    "reference",
    "ovn-kubernetes"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kube_node_info, k8s_cluster_name)",
        "query": "label_values(kube_node_info, k8s_cluster_name)",
        "current": {},
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "description": "Kubernetes cluster, from the Prometheus label k8s_cluster_name (OTel resource k8s.cluster.name)."
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(ovnkube_controller_build_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}, instance)",
        "query": "label_values(ovnkube_controller_build_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}, instance)",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3,
        "description": "ovnkube-controller scrape instance. Empty when those metrics are not scraped."
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Reference - OVN-Kubernetes Controller",
  "uid": "nke-ovn-kubernetes-controller-reference",
  "weekStart": ""
}
